---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import { tools } from '../data/projects';
---
<MainLayout title="About — Karan Kalra">
  <section class="content-page wrap"><a class="back-link" href="/">← Home</a><div class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT ME</div><h1>Joy, Whimsy and a bit of <span class="gradient-text">Bullshit</span></h1><p class="page-lede">I'm Karan Kalra, a game programming student who enjoys making and playing games.</p><div class="about-grid"><section class="about-panel"><div class="eyebrow">WHAT I ENJOY</div><h2>A little bit of Everything</h2><p>Playing games has been my biggest hobby since childhood and I have always been interested in puzzles and things that require logical reasoning. When professor Utonium accidently added C++ into the formula, an interest for making Video games was born. Since my teens, I have always had an interest in finding out how games are made and make games myself. </p><p>I enjoy all aspects of game development from gameplay programming, to engine work all the way into graphics programming, but if I were to pick one I enjoy gameplay programming the most so I can visually see my work come to life.</p></section><section class="about-panel"><div class="eyebrow">CURRENT TOOLKIT</div><div class="tools-grid about-tools">{tools.map((tool) => <span class="tool-chip">{tool}</span>)}</div><div class="cv-slot"><h3>CV / Résumé</h3><a class="button button-secondary" href="/cv.pdf">View CV ↗</a></div></section></div></section>
</MainLayout>
